  cat <<'EOF'
Worker features:
  tools          built-in file/search tools; Codex uses read-only shell
  commandline    command execution and workspace writes (requires tools)
  skills         approved worker-context/<worker>/skills/*/SKILL.md
  agents-md      protected worker-context/<worker>/AGENTS.md
  claude-md      protected worker-context/<worker>/CLAUDE.md

Aliases: tool-use=tools, shell/terminal=commandline,
         AGENTS.md=agents-md, CLAUDE.md=claude-md
